paperweight-skel (0.2.29-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * gtkgreet CSS: remove `max-height` from combobox hide rule — GTK4 does
    not support max-height and rejects the entire stylesheet when it sees it.
    The remaining min-height/opacity/padding/margin properties are sufficient.

